{"4126270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "That's Not My Kind", "steam_appid": 4126270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Year 2155 — The World After the Fall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the nuclear war, Earth lies in ruins.<br>Toxic leaks and radioactive storms have turned entire regions into forbidden wastelands.<br>Among the survivors, many have mutated — losing their sanity, their humanity… and becoming something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/9bff7e8152125c62928b9e3d24bb9c84.poster.avif?t=1763100100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/9bff7e8152125c62928b9e3d24bb9c84.webm?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧬Humanity’s Last Line of Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a few safe zones remain across three continents.<br>You are a member of the <strong>Mutant Detection Unit (M.D.U.)</strong>, humanity’s final safeguard.<br>Your duty: <strong>inspect every entrant</strong> from the contaminated zones —<br>verify their identity, observe their behavior, and decide who may pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/7f3fd57ed405ee344209671aece7282c.poster.avif?t=1763100100\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/7f3fd57ed405ee344209671aece7282c.webm?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/7f3fd57ed405ee344209671aece7282c.mp4?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔎Attention to Detail Means Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, new faces arrive — desperate, wounded, terrified.<br>But one wrong call could unleash a monster inside the walls.<br>Scrutinize every clue. Spot the inconsistencies.<br>Because in this world, <strong>a single mistake can doom an entire colony.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/519f96c73b232f0946737003a706eb66.poster.avif?t=1763100100\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/519f96c73b232f0946737003a706eb66.webm?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/519f96c73b232f0946737003a706eb66.mp4?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚠️One Job. Infinite Consequences.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about who enters —<br>It’s about who <strong>you</strong> trust.<br>Your judgment defines humanity’s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/ceb8209ec0fb9164bc4c8f47c3297908.poster.avif?t=1763100100\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/ceb8209ec0fb9164bc4c8f47c3297908.webm?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/ceb8209ec0fb9164bc4c8f47c3297908.mp4?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠Do You Have What It Takes?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Mutant Detection Unit</strong> and help protect the last bastions of civilization.<br>The fate of mankind rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/e61e4a9a1f4e3b1609941fa96eadc7ea.poster.avif?t=1763100100\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/e61e4a9a1f4e3b1609941fa96eadc7ea.webm?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/e61e4a9a1f4e3b1609941fa96eadc7ea.mp4?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Year 2155 — The World After the Fall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the nuclear war, Earth lies in ruins.<br>Toxic leaks and radioactive storms have turned entire regions into forbidden wastelands.<br>Among the survivors, many have mutated — losing their sanity, their humanity… and becoming something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/9bff7e8152125c62928b9e3d24bb9c84.poster.avif?t=1763100100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/9bff7e8152125c62928b9e3d24bb9c84.webm?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧬Humanity’s Last Line of Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a few safe zones remain across three continents.<br>You are a member of the <strong>Mutant Detection Unit (M.D.U.)</strong>, humanity’s final safeguard.<br>Your duty: <strong>inspect every entrant</strong> from the contaminated zones —<br>verify their identity, observe their behavior, and decide who may pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/7f3fd57ed405ee344209671aece7282c.poster.avif?t=1763100100\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/7f3fd57ed405ee344209671aece7282c.webm?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/7f3fd57ed405ee344209671aece7282c.mp4?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔎Attention to Detail Means Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, new faces arrive — desperate, wounded, terrified.<br>But one wrong call could unleash a monster inside the walls.<br>Scrutinize every clue. Spot the inconsistencies.<br>Because in this world, <strong>a single mistake can doom an entire colony.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/519f96c73b232f0946737003a706eb66.poster.avif?t=1763100100\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/519f96c73b232f0946737003a706eb66.webm?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/519f96c73b232f0946737003a706eb66.mp4?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚠️One Job. Infinite Consequences.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about who enters —<br>It’s about who <strong>you</strong> trust.<br>Your judgment defines humanity’s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/ceb8209ec0fb9164bc4c8f47c3297908.poster.avif?t=1763100100\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/ceb8209ec0fb9164bc4c8f47c3297908.webm?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/ceb8209ec0fb9164bc4c8f47c3297908.mp4?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠Do You Have What It Takes?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Mutant Detection Unit</strong> and help protect the last bastions of civilization.<br>The fate of mankind rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/e61e4a9a1f4e3b1609941fa96eadc7ea.poster.avif?t=1763100100\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/e61e4a9a1f4e3b1609941fa96eadc7ea.webm?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/e61e4a9a1f4e3b1609941fa96eadc7ea.mp4?t=1763100100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The year is 2155. As an officer of the Mutant Detection Unit, you stand guard at humanity’s last safe zones after a global nuclear catastrophe. Inspect, question, and decide who’s human—because one mistake could doom them all.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Korean, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Vietnamese, Arabic", "he